[[179.0, 844.0], [1285.0, 844.0], [1285.0, 870.0], [179.0, 870.0]], 'Theimportanceofthisresearchisdemonstratedbythelargenumberofcriticallyillpatients', 0.9860538471490145], [[[176.0, 875.0], [1345.0, 874.0], [1345.0, 903.0], [176.0, 904.0]], 'requiring MV treated in NHS ICUs each year. Of the 337,312 admissions to ICUs participating in', 0.9876035122161216], [[[176.0, 937.0], [1279.0, 937.0], [1279.0, 967.0], [176.0, 967.0]], '2017 and 31 March 2019, 96,028 (29%) received MV during their stay. Of these, 34% died', 0.992694401463797], [[[176.0, 968.0], [1324.0, 969.0], [1324.0, 999.0], [176.0, 998.0]], 'before hospital discharge, extending to an anticipated 37% by 90 days. With the risk ratio from', 0.9864951610565186], [[[177.0, 1002.0], [1284.0, 1002.0], [1284.0, 1031.0], [177.0, 1031.0]], 'our meta-analysis of 0.91 (0.75 to 1.09) in favour of more conservative oxygen therapy, if a', 0.974395805079004], [[[177.0, 1033.0], [1317.0, 1033.0], [1317.0, 1062.0], [177.0, 1062.0]], 'similar effect size is observed in UK-ROX, this would equate to >3,0o0 lives saved annually in', 0.9545876491577068], [[[177.0, 1126.0], [367.0, 1130.0], [366.0, 1160.0], [176.0, 1155.0]], 'after discharge.', 0.9782137684524059], [[[178.0, 1191.0], [1347.0, 1191.0], [1347.0, 1220.0], [178.0, 1220.0]], 'The proportion of admissions to adult ICUs in the UK receiving MV has remained >30% over the', 0.9733364173899526], [[[175.0, 1221.0], [1354.0, 1221.0], [1354.0, 1253.0], [175.0, 1253.0]], 'past 10 years17 and is expected to rise with increasing admissions of elderly patients. The recent', 0.9816758608331486], [[[178.0, 1254.0], [1333.0, 1254.0], [1333.0, 1280.0], [178.0, 1280.0]], 'COVID-19pandemic,inwhich72%of ICUpatients withCOVID-19 received MV during the first', 0.9662406013672611], [[[175.0, 1279.0], [1293.0, 1279.0], [1293.0, 1318.0], [175.0, 1318.0]], 'epidemic wave,18. 19 demonstrates the need for a comprehensive evidence base for patients', 0.9981368023358034], [[[177.0, 1317.0], [1282.0, 1317.0], [1282.0, 1346.0], [177.0, 1346.0]], 'requiring MV as part of their ICU care. As a specialised high-cost service, it is imperative to', 0.9729394849977995], [[[179.0, 1349.0], [1077.0, 1349.0], [1077.0, 1378.0], [179.0, 1378.0]], 'optimise treatments that are delivered to large proportions of ICU patients.', 0.974515645911819], [[[176.0, 1410.0], [1285.0, 1411.0], [1285.0, 1441.0], [176.0, 1440.0]], 'We aim to conduct an ambitious, cost-efficient, data-enabled trial to address a fundamental', 0.9896782630092495], [[[177.0, 1443.0], [1239.0, 1443.0], [1239.0, 1472.0], [177.0, 1472.0]], 'knowledge gap in intensive care medicine. We will evaluate the clinical effectiveness of', 0.9729306535287336], [[[177.0, 1506.0], [1321.0, 1508.0], [1321.0, 1538.0], [177.0, 1536.0]], 'cost-effectiveness for incremental costs, quality-adjusted life years (QALYs) and net monetary', 0.9969845426843521], [[[176.0, 1538.0], [1273.0, 1539.0], [1273.0, 1568.0], [176.0, 1567.0]], 'benefit at 90 days. We propose an RCT that will recruit 16,500 MV ICU patients into either', 0.9737060546875], [[[176.0, 1572.0], [1291.0, 1570.0], [1291.0, 1599.0], [176.0, 1601.0]], 'conservative orusualoxygen therapy.Wewish to provide a definitive answer as to whether', 0.958029332549073], [[[173.0, 1631.0], [1346.0, 1633.0], [1346.0, 1666.0], [173.0, 1664.0]], 'from this develop national guidance that can be easily and immediately implemented throughout', 0.9910546573259498], [[[176.0, 1666.0], [288.0, 1666.0], [288.0, 1693.0], [176.0, 1693.0]], 'theNHS.', 0.9341839551925659], [[[178.0, 1722.0], [536.0, 1722.0], [536.0, 1750.0], [178.0, 1750.0]], '1.4 UK-ROX and Mega-ROX', 0.9363948080850684], [[[202.0, 1864.0], [757.0, 1864.0], [757.0, 1893.0], [202.0, 1893.0]], 'UK-ROX Trial Protocol v1.8, 14 October 2024', 0.9877792610678562], [[[1297.0, 1863.0], [1333.0, 1863.0], [1333.0, 1893.0], [1297.0, 1893.0]], '12', 0.9995470941066742]]
